  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞２楼　节目走廊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞伙伴们正在参观走廊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 02 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}啊，抱歉。\n你是来叫我们出发的吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}还不急{F5 47 02 01 03 01 05 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}差不多该走了{F5 47 02 01 03 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}这样啊。\n那要不要一起稍微逛逛？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 7F 03}{F5 C1 10 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}，你看过那边的电影院了吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:4:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}感觉像是把知名电影的精彩片段\n全拼在一起，虽然看不懂剧情，\n但好像很有趣呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}真想大家一起看。不过现在，\n还是有点在意那座迷宫……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 03 01 21 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}嗯，那我们这就走吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 F0 0A}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}那、那个，请等一下。\n能再多告诉我一些\n关于大家的事情吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:7:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}掌握的信息越多，\n导航时或许……\n就越容易帮上忙。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C2 07}战斗方式吗？\n{F5 C1 0D 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}用的，\n我记得是大剑吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 60 11}嗯。\n我不擅长从后排攻击，\n但在{F2 01 03 01}前排就能发挥全部实力{F2 01 01 01}。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}人格面具{F2 01 03 01}擅长电击属性{F2 01 01 01}，\n所以今后应该还会学到\n更多这类技能。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0092",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 09 01 21 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2E 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}除此之外……\n似乎就没什么特别的了……\n总之，我会努力的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 05 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 7F 03}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}我的武器，当然就是这双腿！\n平时一直模仿功夫动作来锻炼！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:11:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}阴影什么的，一脚就能踢倒！\n虽、虽然攻击距离比较短……\n可不是说我的腿短哦！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0102",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}还有，我的人格面具\n和我一样{F2 01 03 01}擅长物理攻击{F2 01 01 01}。\n不过魔法之类的就有点不擅长……吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0103",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 03 01 06 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C0 03}说到防御，{F2 01 03 01}冰属性倒没问题{F2 01 01 01}，\n但我不擅长应付火焰……\n明明我比较喜欢夏天啊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 05 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3D 04}我的武器是扇子。\n把扇子投出去攻击。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:14:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}因为是投射武器，{F2 01 03 01}从后排攻击，\n威力也不会降低{F2 01 01 01}。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:14:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}还有，人格面具{F2 01 03 01}擅长魔法{F2 01 01 01}。\n尤其是{F2 01 03 01}恢复和火焰攻击{F2 01 01 01}，\n希望大家能放心交给我。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:14:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 05 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}阴影的攻击，{F2 01 03 01}如果是火焰就不可怕{F2 01 01 01}。\n相对的，冰属性\n算是有一点……弱点吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 09 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 48 0B}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}大家的战斗方式真丰富呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 0D 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}和顺平竟然用同一种武器，\n有点让人意外……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 CA 0A}架势完全不同，确实很惊讶呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C6 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}我不是那个意思……嗯，算了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 02 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我们也有很多不明白的事，\n不过，会努力成为可靠的伙伴。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}请多关照{F5 47 02 01 03 01 07 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:20:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}一起加油吧{F5 47 02 01 03 01 07 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:21:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_018",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 03 01 21 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 60 11}嗯。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:22:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 03 01 21 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 60 11}嗯……对啊。\n是一起呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:23:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 05 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 7D 03}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}那一起去吃肉吧！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:24:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C3 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}咦，为什么？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:25:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}庆祝彼此熟悉起来呀。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:26:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C2 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}啊……咦，为什么？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_010.bf.json:27:0",
